flowchart
  accTitle: HTTP client ownership lasts through response cleanup
  accDescr: Admission and pool wait precede socket assignment and headers; the caller still owns bounded body consumption or cancellation before resources can be released.
A["Admitted: total budget starts"] --> Q["Pool queue<br/>socket cap does not cap queue"]
  Q --> S["Socket assigned<br/>new: setup / reused: skip setup"]
  S --> H["Response headers received<br/>body still owned"]
  H --> B["Bounded body consumption<br/>or deliberate cancellation"]
  B --> E["Release resources<br/>reusable only if eligible"]
